**House Ganzaryk** (/'*gɑnsaːrik*/, *[[arethian|Arethian]]*: Γανσαρικ) are one of the four [[enkoan-trading-houses|Enkoan Trading Houses]].  They are the head of the Ironspine Trading Company and their reputation tells that they deliver reliable essential materials.

## Etymology
A amalgamation of *Ganzaf*, meaning stone, and *Ryk*, meaning shield.

## History
House Ganzaryk was founded by Doran Ganzaryk, one of the sons of Wylan Seagrin. Doran was as adventurous and inspiring as his father. He founded Ironspine Trading Company which failed to flower in its first years, but with his pure will he made it into something promising. Ironspine Trading Company now holds a reputation of delivering quality essential goods.
